
Q45. Sum of Series: 2/3 + 4/7 + 6/11 + 8/15 + ... up to n Terms

CODE:
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    int n, i;
    float sum = 0;

    printf("Enter number of terms: ");
    scanf("%d", &n);

    for (i = 1; i <= n; i++)
        sum = sum + (float)(2 * i) / (4 * i - 1);

    printf("Sum = %.4f\n", sum);
    return 0;
}

SAMPLE OUTPUT:
Enter number of terms: 4
Sum = 2.2317


Q46. Print 5 x 5 Star Pattern

